{
  "$comment": [
    "CompanyIntel — SMOKE-TEST config for the full-index pipeline.",
    "",
    "Identical sources and mapping overrides to indexer.dev-full.json, but its own",
    "work/output directories and a small partition/shard layout, so it can run in a",
    "few seconds on a machine that cannot hold the full corpus. Its purpose is to",
    "exercise EVERY stage of `bun run index:full` (dependency and source-version",
    "checks, preflight, Pass 1, Pass 2, validation, coverage labelling, summary)",
    "without touching the verified development or benchmark artifacts.",
    "",
    "It is also what tests/full-index-pipeline.test.ts runs against, so the operator",
    "path and the tested path are the same one.",
    "",
    "Run:  bun scripts/full-index.mjs --config tools/indexer/indexer.dev-smoke.json \\",
    "        --version dev-smoke-<date> --sample 2000 --no-upload --yes",
    "",
    "A SAMPLE, not the dataset: the pipeline labels it PARTIAL and refuses to activate it."
  ],
  "datasetVersion": "dev-smoke",
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "csv1",
      "path": "r2://company-intel-data/raw/file1.csv",
      "encoding": "utf-8",
      "delimiter": "\t",
      "columns": {
        "companyid": "organization_id",
        "companyname": "organization_name",
        "companydomain": "organization_domain",
        "companywebsite": "organization_website_url",
        "industry": "organization_industries",
        "companysize": "organization_num_current_employees",
        "companyrevenue": "organization_revenue_in_thousands_int",
        "companycity": "organization_hq_location_city",
        "companystate": "organization_hq_location_state",
        "companycountry": "organization_hq_location_country"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "csv2",
      "path": "r2://company-intel-data/raw/file2.csv",
      "encoding": "utf-8",
      "delimiter": "\t",
      "columns": {
        "contactname": "person_name",
        "firstname": "person_first_name_unanalyzed",
        "lastname": "person_last_name_unanalyzed",
        "jobtitle": "person_title",
        "seniority": "person_seniority",
        "department": "person_functions",
        "email": "person_email",
        "phone": "person_phone",
        "linkedin": "person_linkedin_url",
        "contactcity": "person_location_city",
        "contactstate": "person_location_state",
        "contactcountry": "person_location_country",
        "companyname": "sanitized_organization_name_unanalyzed"
      }
    }
  ],
  "workDir": ".indexer-dev-work-smoke",
  "outputDir": ".indexer-dev-output-smoke",
  "rawCacheDir": null,
  "partitions": 8,
  "shards": {
    "exact": 8,
    "prefix": 8,
    "token": 8,
    "trigram": 8,
    "ids": 8
  },
  "upload": {
    "enabled": false,
    "bucket": "company-intel-data"
  }
}
